{
  "acceptance": [
    "Semantics test: a small fixture with four orders (one supplier; two suppliers, one late; two suppliers, both late; three suppliers, one late) runs through complete TPC-H Q21 and Data Vault Q21 on Polars and DataFusion and returns `numwait` only for the second and fourth orders' late supplier. It passes on the batch start head and on the member head.",
    "Existing reference-answer, Dask-parity and TPC-Havoc equivalence tests for Q21 pass unchanged.",
    "Decision gate 1 outcome: every TPC-Havoc Q21 variant is listed as changed or kept with a one-line reason in this item's context.",
    "Timing gate: complete TPC-H Q21, Data Vault Q21 and each changed TPC-Havoc Q21 variant on polars-df, datafusion-df and pyspark-df at SF1 and SF10, measured as described in the context. PASS or FAIL is recorded with the table before the final PR is armed, and the landed commits match the outcome.",
    "`make batch-member-check TESTS=<the new test file>` passes on the member head; `make comment-policy-check` reports no finding for the touched files.",
